## Personal Overlays (gitignored)

`AGENTS.local.md` and `.cursor/rules/local.*.mdc` are personal, not team system
of record. Do NOT gitignore team `AGENTS.md` / platform rules to personalize --
use overlays instead.

## Core Rules

- Any architectural or refactor work MUST begin with a plan file (see the shared
  plan template under {{ shared.templates_dir }}).
- Every feature or bug fix MUST include corresponding tests.
- Follow the shared standards and collaboration protocol referenced above.
- Do NOT modify `{{ project.system_architecture_file }}` without explicit human
  approval and a changelog entry.
- Emojis are forbidden in repository content.

## AgentScaffold MCP Tools

Prefer AgentScaffold MCP tools first when a request matches a known intent. In a
multi-project workspace, pass `working_path` (MCP) or `--project` (CLI) so reads
scope to this project. The full intent-to-tool map is generated into the
platform routing rules (`.cursor/rules/agentscaffold.mdc`, etc.).
